   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCO201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13652 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CCO201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>; <strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13652 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong></td><td>Joep P. Cornelissen</td><td>SAGE Publications Ltd</td><td>2020</td><td>6th</td><td><code>9781526491978</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong></td><td>Joep P. Cornelissen</td><td>SAGE Publications Ltd</td><td>2020</td><td>6th</td><td><code>1526491982, 9781526491985</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong></td><td>Joep P. Cornelissen</td><td>SAGE Publications Ltd</td><td>2017</td><td>5th</td><td><code>1526411822, 9781526411822</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>https.//hbr.org (Corporate Communication – HBR/ Harvard Business review)</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>https.//network.bepress.com (Business and Corporate Communications – open access section)</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Content Creation With Generative AI</strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Prompt Engineering Specialization</strong></td><td></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Corporate Communication: A Guide to Theory and Practice</strong></td><td>Joep P. Cornelissen</td><td>SAGE Publications Ltd</td><td>2023</td><td>7th</td><td><code>9781529600025</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>Chọn 1 trong các giáo trình (ưu tiên mua sách mới)</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p><em>not published by the university</em></p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p><em>trường không công bố</em></p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13652\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13652</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13652\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13652</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
